lemma realizesV (h:3 ≤ t)(he:t+2≤d')(b:ChangeQ) (S:Flight b.old b.new)(ht:S.patch.Branches K su)(Θ σ Λ:ℝ)(p:ParcelR)(U:LedgerQ (P₀ b) tol S Θ σ Λ p): ∀ᶠ x in atTop,TermV P₀ E l₁ l₂ lℓ kℓ mℓ t d' gT _ _ _ _ _ _ U x:=
